          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I sense in you great power. You are not with the expedition, or with Morganthe’s invaders.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225833,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Celestian wardens have long held the line against the Morgantine invaders. Even the sea could not quench our fire.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225833,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "When the dark queen of the Shadow-Web came to Celestia to learn our magic, she was sent away by our Wizards.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225833,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "She returned to take it, and our army met hers on the field of battle. We were undone by an unreliable ally... the Storm Titan.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225833,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Storm Titan pulled Celestia beneath the waves, ending the war and hiding Celestia from the Spiral for once and all.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225833,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Aeons later, we are still locked in a war we cannot win... two warring planets orbiting an ever-burning sun.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225833,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I sense that you wish to learn the secret of Celestian magic... and that you have been proven worthy.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 225833,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "CL-RIVEN-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "My counterpart among the Morgantine forces is Karolak Nightspinner. Go and speak to him. He will tell you more.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_CL_Celestian_Legion_Ghost_03_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_CL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AlaricMoonsunder_CEL_08.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
